  - [e.g., - Fragile: Glass display cabinet - needs packing.]
  - [If none, write "Standard Residential Move".]

## Action Items
- [Tasks for office/crew.]
- [e.g., - Send COI to building.]

## Customer Pain Points
- [Specific worries only.]

## Call Summary
[1 sentence TL;DR.]

## Sentiment Analysis
[Positive/Neutral/Negative - Reason]

## CALENDAR TITLE DETAILS
- Customer First Name: [Name or (N/A)]
- Estimated Weight for Calendar: [e.g., 2.5K or 1500 lbs. Use 'K' for thousands.]
- Pickup Location for Calendar (City, Province/State Abbreviation): [City, 2-letter PROV Abbrev or (N/A). e.g. BRAMPTON, ON]
- Delivery Location for Calendar (City, Province/State Abbreviation): [City, 2-letter PROV Abbrev or (N/A). e.g. EDMONTON, AB]
